# S1P. The operator's SendGrid deployment documents hold real API keys and live OUTSIDE this
# repository by design; these patterns exist for the case where an operator points a locator
# at a path inside the working tree anyway. No file matching them is ever committed.
*.sendgrid-deployment.json
